{"uid":"63dbaf6ae1c31511","name":"[BUG-DB-003] TC-DB-003 — Impossible date (Feb-30) causes HTTP 500 instead of 400","fullName":"backend-deep-regression-api.spec.ts:788:7","historyId":"a11baaba41ba6b1e2365c498a474cab6:5aca1799530dbd308fd41b1459dc9565","time":{"start":1789018564913,"stop":1789018568063,"duration":3150},"description":"**[BUG-DB-003]**\n\nPassing an impossible date like `from_date=2026-02-30` (February 30th does not exist) causes the server to return HTTP 500 Internal Server Error instead of 400 Bad Request.\n\n**Expected:** HTTP 400 with `\"message\":\"from_date is not a valid date (2026-02-30 does not exist)\"`\n\n**Root Cause:** The date is not validated before being passed to the database/ORM layer, which throws an unhandled exception when it tries to parse February 30th.\n\n**Impact:** Exposes unhandled server exceptions to clients; 500 errors are monitored as outages in alerting systems — a single bad client request can trigger false alarms.","descriptionHtml":"<p><strong>[BUG-DB-003]</strong></p>\n<p>Passing an impossible date like <code>from_date=2026-02-30</code> (February 30th does not exist) causes the server to return HTTP 500 Internal Server Error instead of 400 Bad Request.</p>\n<p><strong>Expected:</strong> HTTP 400 with <code>&quot;message&quot;:&quot;from_date is not a valid date (2026-02-30 does not exist)&quot;</code></p>\n<p><strong>Root Cause:</strong> The date is not validated before being passed to the database/ORM layer, which throws an unhandled exception when it tries to parse February 30th.</p>\n<p><strong>Impact:</strong> Exposes unhandled server exceptions to clients; 500 errors are monitored as outages in alerting systems — a single bad client request can trigger false alarms.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[],"testStage":{"description":"**[BUG-DB-003]**\n\nPassing an impossible date like `from_date=2026